                    \\frac{\Gamma_{1} \vdash \Delta_{1}, !A, \Delta_{2} \qquad \Gamma_{3} \vdash \Delta_{3}, !A, \Delta_{4}}{\Gamma_{1}, \Gamma_{3} \vdash \Delta_{1}, \Delta_{3}, !A, \Delta_{4}, \Delta_{2}}
